motor-thermostat-lcd
====================
HD44780 16x2 LCD showing average temperature and motor status for the
ESP32C3 motor PID loop.

This is NOT the smart home dashboard.
The smart home dashboard is the STM32 blackpill running LVGL on an
ILI9341 TFT display — see stm32-blackpill/User/Core/ui.c.

Data source: POSIX shared memory /sensor_shm (data_controller must be running).
IPC: pthread_mutex (shm_data->shm_mutex) — NOT the old shm_sem semaphore.

Displays:
  Line 0: PID Tmp:<avg_temp>C
  Line 1: Mtr:<ON|OFF> B:<batt>%
